## Relative Runtime
```julia
cpu_runtimes = [cpu_results[l].runtime for l in cpu_labels]
pso_runtimes = [pso_results[l].runtime for l in pso_labels]
all_runtimes = vcat(cpu_runtimes, pso_runtimes)

ref_idx = findfirst(all_labels .== "NelderMead")
all_runtimes_rel = all_runtimes ./ all_runtimes[ref_idx]

# bar(all_labels, all_runtimes_rel, xrotation = 45, xticks = :all,
